    vpcSecurityGroupIdSelector : RdsAwsmUpboundIoV1beta1InstanceSpecInitProviderVpcSecurityGroupIDSelector, default is Undefined, optional
        vpc security group Id selector
    vpcSecurityGroupIds : [str], default is Undefined, optional
        List of VPC security groups to
        associate.
    """


